  "description": "Harness leverages Claude Code's agent team system to decompose complex tasks into coordinated teams of specialized agents. Say \"build a harness for this project\" and it automatically generates agent definitions (.claude/agents/) and skills (.claude/skills/) tailored to your domain.",
